   "text": "Anglia Ruskin University - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nAnglia Ruskin University - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nAnglia Ruskin University is located in Cambridge and students really get to experience undergraduate life in this beautiful and iconic university city, less than an hour from London. It was awarded Entrepreneurial University of the Year in the 2014 Times Higher Education Awards and won the Duke of York Award for University Entrepreneurship at the Lloyds Bank National Business Awards in 2016.\nThe Anglia Ruskin College offers undergraduate and postgraduate pathways for students that do not meet the requirements for direct entry, have not studied the subjects required for their chosen degree or spent some time out of education. Following completion of the College pathway students benefit from guaranteed entry into an Anglia Ruskin University degree.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 05:44\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:34\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £12,770.00\nMin: £10,840.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n9%\n3,560 of 39,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1858\nCampus(es)\nCambridge, Chelmsford, Peterborough, London\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-RD9R3-DLD8\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
